<section id="A3.SS7.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">C.7.2 </span>Basic Skills</h4>

<div id="A3.SS7.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS7.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ C.7.2 Basic Skills ‣ C.7 Full Benchmark Results on GenAI-Bench ‣ Appendix C Experimental Details and Supplementary Results ‣ Guiding Diffusion Models with Semantically Degraded Conditions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> presents detailed evaluation results for basic compositional skills across SD3, SD3.5, and FLUX.1. These fundamental skills include: Action Relation (capturing action-object interactions), Attribute (object properties), Scene (environmental context), Spatial Relation (object positioning), and Part Relation (part-whole relationships). Our method shows consistent performance gains across all models.</p>
</div>
