<section id="A3.SS8.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">C.8.2 </span>WPR vs. Random Ranking</h4>

<div id="A3.SS8.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS8.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">At the default <math id="A3.SS8.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{deg}}=1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>deg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{deg}}=1.0</annotation></semantics></math>, all content tokens are degraded regardless of ranking, making WPR unnecessary. For <math id="A3.SS8.SSS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{deg}}\neq 1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>deg</mtext></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{deg}}\neq 1.0</annotation></semantics></math>, where only a subset of tokens is degraded, we compare WPR-based ranking against random ranking. Table <a href="#A3.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ C.8.2 WPR vs. Random Ranking ‣ C.8 Encoder Ablation and WPR Analysis ‣ Appendix C Experimental Details and Supplementary Results ‣ Guiding Diffusion Models with Semantically Degraded Conditions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> shows results at <math id="A3.SS8.SSS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{deg}}=0.9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>deg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{deg}}=0.9</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.SS8.SSS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{deg}}=1.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>deg</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{deg}}=1.1</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>WPR vs. Random ranking ablation on SD3.</figcaption>
